# Server pull — ALWAYS --rebase (locked)

Founder rule. Agent is ke khilaaf **nahi** jata.

## Pull flag (locked)

| | |
|---|---|
| **ALWAYS** | `git pull --rebase origin main` |
| **NEVER** | `git pull --no-rebase` |

**Reason:** `--no-rebase` server pe unnecessary merge commits banata hai — git history unreadable.

## ONE COMMAND RULE (locked)

- Har server task = **ek** copy-paste ready command
- Alag-alag “pehle X, phir Y, phir Z” **banned**
- Sab steps `&&` se **ek block** mein

## Canonical pulls

**Frontend (Bun SSR :3000):**
```bash
cd /opt/anexomail-web && git restore src/routeTree.gen.ts && git pull --rebase origin main && bun install && bun run build:bun && pm2 restart anexomail-web --update-env && pm2 save && curl -s -o /dev/null -w "web /health %{http_code}\n" --max-time 5 http://127.0.0.1:3000/health
```

**Rust PRIMARY engine (:3200 — ANEXOChat / mail /rpc /wt):**
```bash
cd /opt/anexomail-web && git pull --rebase origin main && bash server/rust/deploy.sh
```

Agent `web /health` **200** confirm kare (frontend pull pe). Rust pull pe deploy.sh khud health print karta hai.
